      "id": "CVE-2026-92392",
      "publishedDate": "2026-10-14T07:46:15.160Z",
      "lastModifiedDate": "2026-10-18T20:07:08.700Z",
      "description": "During an upload, curl mishandles HTTP/2 `RST_STREAM` received from the server\n(with reason `HTTP_1_1_REQUIRED` or `REFUSED_STREAM`) leading to a use after\nfree of a `struct Curl_easy` object.",
      "severity": "5.5",
      "fix_suggestion": "📦 受影响组件：curl curl\n🔓 漏洞类型：Use After Free (CWE-416)\n📊 官方评级：MEDIUM (CVSS 5.5)\n🛠️ 修复建议：\n1. 确认受影响的版本范围（见上方 Affected Products）\n2. 升级到厂商官方发布的最稳定安全版本\n3. 检查官方安全公告获取补丁链接\n4. 如无法立即升级，实施临时缓解措施：\n   - 网络层：WAF 规则 / IPS 签名 / 零信任策略\n   - 主机层：最小化暴露面 / 禁用危险功能 / 输入过滤\n5. 修复后使用 NVD / 厂商 PoC 验证修复有效性",
